#. Description of the 'Enable Code Interpreter' (Check) field in DocType 'Raven
#. Bot'
#: raven/raven_bot/doctype/raven_bot/raven_bot.json
msgid ""
" Enable this if you want the bot to be able to process files like Excel "
"sheets or data from Insights.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    OpenAI Assistants run code in a sandboxed environment "
"(on OpenAI servers) to do this."
msgstr ""
" Excel シートや Insights のデータなどのファイルをボットで処理できるようにする場合は有効にしてください。\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    OpenAI Assistants は、この処理のためにサンドボックス環境（OpenAI "
"のサーバー上）でコードを実行します。"

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Add users'
#: raven/raven/onboarding_step/adding_users_to_raven/adding_users_to_raven.json
msgid ""
"## Adding Users\n"
"\n"
"To access Raven, users need to have the **Raven User** role.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the \"Users\" list and add the role to the users you want on Raven."
msgstr ""
"## ユーザーの追加\n"
"\n"
"Raven を利用するには、ユーザーに **Raven User** ロールが必要です。\n"
"\n"
"「ユーザー」一覧を開き、Raven を使わせたいユーザーにこのロールを追加してください。"

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Understanding Channels'
#: raven/raven/onboarding_step/introduction_to_raven/introduction_to_raven.json
msgid ""
"## Channels\n"
"\n"
"Raven helps you and your team communicate with each other.\n"
"\n"
"Conversation happen in **channels**. \n"
"\n"
"All users who have access to Raven can view and send messages in **Open** "
"channels. \n"
"\n"
"**Public** channels are visible to everyone, but only members can take send "
"messages in them. Any user can join public channels. \n"
"\n"
"**Private** channels are only visible to members and new members can only be"
" added by the channel admin - which is the creator of the channel. \n"
"\n"
"You could also send messages to other users privately via **Direct "
"messages** - including yourself!\n"
"\n"
"A user could create as many channels and add as many users as they want to "
"in them. "
msgstr ""
"## チャンネル\n"
"\n"
"Raven はチームのメンバー同士のコミュニケーションを支援します。\n"
"\n"
"会話は **チャンネル** で行います。 \n"
"\n"
"Raven にアクセスできるすべてのユーザーは、**オープン** チャンネルのメッセージを閲覧・送信できます。 \n"
"\n"
"**公開** チャンネルは全員が閲覧できますが、メッセージを送信できるのはメンバーだけです。公開チャンネルにはどのユーザーでも参加できます。 \n"
"\n"
"**非公開** チャンネルはメンバーだけが閲覧でき、新しいメンバーを追加できるのはチャンネルの管理者（チャンネルの作成者）だけです。 \n"
"\n"
"**ダイレクトメッセージ** で他のユーザーに個別にメッセージを送ることもできます。自分自身にも送れます。\n"
"\n"
"ユーザーはチャンネルをいくつでも作成でき、好きなだけユーザーを追加できます。 "

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Review Settings'
#: raven/raven/onboarding_step/review_raven_settings/review_raven_settings.json
msgid ""
"## Raven Settings\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"<em>**Automatically adding users to Raven**</em>\n"
"\n"
"To make it easy for you, the Raven User role is assigned to any user who has"
" access to Desk. If you wish to turn this off, please head to Raven "
"Settings."
msgstr ""
"## Raven 設定\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"<em>**Raven へのユーザーの自動追加**</em>\n"
"\n"
"手間を省くため、Desk にアクセスできるユーザーには Raven User ロールが自動で割り当てられます。これを無効にする場合は、Raven "
"設定を開いてください。"

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'It's time. Send a Raven.'
#: raven/raven/onboarding_step/access_the_web_app/access_the_web_app.json
msgid ""
"### Access the web and mobile apps\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Raven is available at <a href=\"/raven\">**/raven**</a> for both web and "
"mobile. On mobile, Raven can be installed as a PWA."
msgstr ""
"### Web アプリとモバイルアプリの利用\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Raven は Web・モバイルとも <a href=\"/raven\">**/raven**</a> で利用できます。モバイルでは PWA "
"としてインストールできます。"

